    "prompt_additions": "Basic unit is ARTICLE (not SECTION). SECTION is a higher division above articles. Hierarchy: BOOK > TITLE > CHAPTER > SECTION > ARTICLE > SUBSECTION/PARAGRAPH. Dual calendar: extract both Gregorian and Hijri dates from document headers. Both Arabic and French text appear — process the language version specified in the job metadata. Alinéas within articles: if numbered use SUBSECTION; if unnumbered flag for post-processing as <alinea> element."
